meta {
  name: Get Readiness
  type: http
  seq: 3
}

get {
  url: {{baseUrl}}/readyz
  body: none
  auth: none
}

docs {
  Gateway serving readiness requires the database and AppView. Projection Pool
  failures remain visible in projection_pool and ingestion_completeness without
  taking healthy serving replicas out of rotation. Observation timestamps describe
  the cached sample, not this request. HTTP 200 does not prove ingestion recovery.
}
